"Last Used" means the Minecraft mod Last Used in every version and form in which cptgummiball
publishes it: the jar files, the compiled code in them, textures, models, icons, sounds, texts,
language files, data files and documentation, and the Last Used API files (section 5).

1. Ownership
   Last Used is the property of cptgummiball. This license gives you limited rights to use it. It
   does not transfer any ownership, copyright or other rights. All rights not expressly granted
   here are reserved.

2. What you may do
   a) Download Last Used from its official pages (Modrinth, CurseForge, and the releases of
      https://github.com/CptGummiball/LastUsed).
   b) Use Last Used to play Minecraft: in singleplayer, and on your own or any other server.
   c) Show Last Used in videos, streams, screenshots, reviews and guides.

3. Modpacks
   You may include Last Used in modpacks, public or private, free or paid, and distribute it as part
   of such a modpack, but only in its original, unmodified state: the jar files exactly as
   cptgummiball published them, not renamed in content, not repackaged, not altered in any way.
   Where the modpack platform can link to the official download instead of copying the file,
   linking is preferred.

4. What you may not do
   Unless cptgummiball has given you written permission, you may not:
   a) modify, adapt, translate, patch or otherwise change Last Used or any part of it, or create
      works derived from it, including modified jar files, forks, ports and re-textures;
   b) decompile, disassemble, deobfuscate or otherwise reverse engineer Last Used, or attempt to
      obtain its source code, except where and only to the extent that applicable law expressly
      allows this despite this restriction;
   c) upload, mirror or distribute Last Used anywhere other than as part of a modpack under
      section 3, or offer it as your own work;
   d) use the textures, models, icons, sounds or texts of Last Used in other projects;
   e) remove or change this license or any copyright notice.

5. Last Used API
   cptgummiball publishes an API for other mods: the Java package dev.cptgummiball.lastused.api (provided as a
   separate API jar with its documentation) and the documented integration classes, if any. You
   may use the API jar, the documentation and the official Last Used jar files as compile-only
   dependencies to develop, compile and distribute your own mods that work together with
   Last Used. Your mod may reference these classes, but must not contain the API classes or
   any other part of Last Used; players install Last Used separately. The API may not be
   modified or redistributed on its own. Sections 1 and 4 apply to the API in all other respects.

6. No warranty
   Last Used is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including
   warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and non-infringement. Back up
   your worlds.

7. Limitation of liability
   To the extent permitted by applicable law, cptgummiball is not liable for any damages arising
   from the use of or inability to use Last Used, including loss of data or of game worlds.
   Liability for intent and gross negligence, and any liability that cannot be excluded by law,
